{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:54:38+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:54:38+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Tomra Systems ASA","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Waste Management","country":"Norway","city":"Asker","website":"https://www.tomra.com","employees":5800,"summary":"Tomra Systems ASA provides sensor-based solutions for optimal resource productivity worldwide. It operates through four segments: TOMRA Collection, TOMRA Recycling, TOMRA Food, and TOMRA Horizon. The company provides reverse vending machines and related data management systems; and provides pick-up, transportation, and processing services of empty beverage containers on behalf of beverage producers/fillers. It also develops, produces, sale, and service sorting and processing technology for waste management companies or plant builders; and provides sorting systems for waste and metal material streams, as well as ore sorting sensors for mining companies. In addition, the company provides post-harvest food solutions for fresh and processed food industries. The company was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Asker, Norway.","exchange":"Oslo","currency":"NOK","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Tomra Systems ASA fournit des solutions basées sur des capteurs pour une productivité optimale des ressources dans le monde entier. Il opère à travers quatre segments: TOMRA Collection, TOMRA Recycling, TOMRA Food et TOMRA Horizon. La société fournit des distributeurs automatiques inversés et des systèmes de gestion des données connexes; et fournit des services de ramassage, de transport et de traitement des contenants de boissons vides au nom des producteurs de boissons / remplisseurs.","summary_fr_excerpt":true},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":28535087104,"shares_outstanding":295700378,"trailing_pe":27.890173,"forward_pe":17.64051,"price_to_book":4.475731,"ev_to_ebitda":122.208,"ev